# Next.js / React Frontend

## Stack

- Next.js 15.5.x, React 19, TypeScript 5.7, Node 20 LTS (see `docs/project-versions.md`).

## Conventions

- App Router (`app/` directory); prefer Server Components by default.
- Client Components only when interactivity requires it (`"use client"`).
- Colocate feature code under `frontend/src/features/<feature>/`.
- Shared UI in `frontend/src/components/`.

## Data Fetching

- Call backend REST API at `/api/v1/`; keep API client in `frontend/src/lib/api/`.
- Handle loading, error, and empty states in UI.

## Styling

- Match existing patterns once introduced; do not add a new CSS framework without approval.
